@startuml
title US-006 - Choose plan before registering - SD level 3 - Backend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

participant "Web App" as FE
participant "PlansController" as Controller
participant "PlanService" as Service
participant "IPlanRepository" as PlanRepo
participant "PlanMapper" as Mapper
participant "NexoDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

note over Controller, DB
  Read-only; there is no validation or authorization branch. The
  planId change to POST /organizations is shown in US-001's diagrams.
end note

activate FE
FE -> Controller: GET /plans
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: GetAll()
activate Service
Service -> PlanRepo: GetAllAsync()
activate PlanRepo
PlanRepo -> DbContext: Query all Plans
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: SELECT * FROM Plans
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: Query result (possibly empty)
deactivate DB
DbContext --> PlanRepo: Materialized result
deactivate DbContext
PlanRepo --> Service: Plans
deactivate PlanRepo
Service -> Mapper: Map each Plan to PlanDto
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Service: PlanDto[]
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Controller: PlanDto[]
deactivate Service
Controller --> FE: 200 OK (PlanDto[])
deactivate Controller
deactivate FE
@enduml
